,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,18],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Though Verrazano is by no means considered to be a great explorer, his name will probably remain immortal,","start":38.05,"end":45.38,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-004-p02","sourceId":"b3-017-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[18,34],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"for on November 21st, 1964, the longest suspension bridge in the world was named after him.","start":46.05,"end":53.26,"score":0.965,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-005","sourceId":"b3-017-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"The Verrazano Bridge, which was designed by Othmar Ammann, joins Brooklyn to Staten Island.","start":54.74,"end":61.96,"score":0.939,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-006","sourceId":"b3-017-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"It has a span of 4, 260 feet.","start":62.85,"end":66.27,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-007","sourceId":"b3-017-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The bridge is so long that the shape of the earth had to be taken into account by its designer.","start":67.37,"end":73.02,"score":0.957,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-008","sourceId":"b3-017-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Two great towers support four huge cables.","start":74.36,"end":77.89,"score":0.875,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-009","sourceId":"b3-017-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The towers are built on immense underwater platforms made of steel and concrete.","start":78.8,"end":84.23,"score":0.873,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-010","sourceId":"b3-017-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"The platforms extend to a depth of over 100 feet under the sea.","start":84.98,"end":89.26,"score":0.983,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-011","sourceId":"b3-017-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"These alone took sixteen months to build.","start":90.23,"end":93.13,"score":0.973,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-012","sourceId":"b3-017-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Above the surface of the water, the towers rise to a height of nearly 700 feet.","start":93.97,"end":99.46,"score":0.987,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-013","sourceId":"b3-017-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They support the cables from which the bridge has been suspended.","start":100.48,"end":104.1,"score":0.985,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-014","sourceId":"b3-017-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Each of the four cables contains 26, 108 lengths of wire.","start":105.23,"end":111.21,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-015-p01","sourceId":"b3-017-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It has been estimated that if the bridge were packed with cars,","start":112.22,"end":115.79,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-015-p02","sourceId":"b3-017-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[12,24],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"it would still only be carrying a third of its total capacity.","start":116.04,"end":119.54,"score":0.99,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-016","sourceId":"b3-017-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"However, size and strength are not the only important things about this bridge.","start":120.58,"end":125.76,"score":0.951,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-017-017","sourceId":"b3-017-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Despite its immensity, it is both simple and elegant, fulfilling its designer's dream to creat 'an enormous object drawn as faintly as possible'.","start":126.98,"end":137.53,"score":0.974,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
